      "statement": "enforce-branch-state.sh requires a new branch named <plan_name>_implementation created from a clean dev checkout and backed by a big plan with type big-plan, one status field, and status planning or in-progress, and then runs the plan-frontmatter validator on the big plan and its listed phase files as explicit paths, denying with the first three errors; a branch created in another repository via -C, --git-dir, or --work-tree is not judged by this repository.",
